0015-gpui-webview-capture.patch (combined series, 2026-11-13). Formerly 0015-gpui-webview-capture.patch (original kept in nsh-host-patches/superseded-2026-11-13/).
Applies with patch -p1 at the root of a copy of nsh-host-allspeech-src after every earlier patch of the series 0010-0020, in order.

gpui: webview.capture host call (PNG of a shown WKWebView page)

Against the all-speech tree (e626a8d + 0001-0003 + 0005 + 0005a + 0006-0009). Adds
`host.call("webview.capture", { point?, rect? })`: the page of the shown web view under
`point` (window points; the largest shown one without it), only `rect` (page points) when
given, from takeSnapshotWithConfiguration:completionHandler:. Resolves
`{ dataUrl, width, height, frame }`. Declare it in nsh.json capabilities.host.

